{% comment %}
  Renders the fit notes under the size selector:

    Fit: Relaxed
    Model Details: Model is 5'9 and is wearing size M
    Fit Recommendation: If you are between sizes, we recommend sizing up.

  The values are product metafields, because every one of them is specific to
  the garment. The labels are block settings, so they stay editable and
  translatable without touching code.

  Each row is independent - a product with a fit but no model shot renders one
  row, and the whole block disappears when none of the three metafields is set.
  That matters during rollout: the block can go live across all templates before
  the metafields are filled in, and nothing renders until a product has data.

  Metafields read (all single line text unless noted):
  - custom.fit
  - custom.model_details
  - custom.fit_recommendation  (multi-line text)

  Accepts:
  - block: {Object} the main-product block carrying the labels.
  - product: {Object} product object.

  Usage:
  {% render 'pdp-fit-details', block: block, product: product %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign fit = product.metafields.custom.fit.value | default: product.metafields.custom.fit
  assign model = product.metafields.custom.model_details.value | default: product.metafields.custom.model_details
  assign recommendation = product.metafields.custom.fit_recommendation.value | default: product.metafields.custom.fit_recommendation
-%}

{%- if fit != blank or model != blank or recommendation != blank -%}
  <div class="pdp-fit" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {%- if fit != blank -%}
      <p class="pdp-fit__row">
        <span class="pdp-fit__label">{{ block.settings.fit_label | default: 'Fit:' | escape }}</span>
        {{ fit }}
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if model != blank -%}
      <p class="pdp-fit__row">
        <span class="pdp-fit__label">{{ block.settings.model_label | default: 'Model Details:' | escape }}</span>
        {{ model }}
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if recommendation != blank -%}
      <p class="pdp-fit__row">
        <span class="pdp-fit__label">
          {{- block.settings.recommendation_label | default: 'Fit Recommendation:' | escape -}}
        </span>
        {{ recommendation }}
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
